# bashy verified build declaration for the OpenClaw gateway (builds/README.md).
# Shell-sourceable KEY=VALUE only. builds/render.sh renders ../fork from this
# file + files/ + build.yml + builds/_shared, and ships it verbatim as the
# fork's bashy-build/PIN. Bump only after reviewing the upstream release diff
# (see builds/openclaw/README.md). ONLY official stable release tags are
# accepted (no main/dev branches, no pre-releases, no RCs).
TOOL=openclaw
FORK_REPO=qiangli/openclaw
UPSTREAM_REPO=https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw
UPSTREAM_SLUG=openclaw/openclaw
UPSTREAM_TAG=v2026.10.2
UPSTREAM_COMMIT=b8952d477f0c932d8ddc6da5c89cab5a169b6ff1
# Toolchain kind: pnpm/Node build steps are tool-specific (build.yml next to
# this file: frozen pnpm install + pnpm build for the build, audit gates, a
# separate frozen pnpm --prod install, runtime-tree assembly per the upstream
# Dockerfile copy list + prune-docker-plugin-dist, tarball of the runtime
# tree, SBOM of the runtime tree, bundled-copy patch + tarball verify, OCI
# image on Linux). No separate audit job.
KIND=custom
# Node 24 (upstream Dockerfile node:24-bookworm), pnpm 12.5.1 (upstream
# packageManager); used by build.yml.
NODE_VERSION=24
PNPM_VERSION=12.5.1
COSIGN_VERSION=v3.1.3
# Per-platform matrix (free GitHub runners only): native modules make the
# prod install OS/arch-specific, so each leg installs and ships its own
# runtime tree. Asset names are openclaw-gateway-<os>-<arch>-${GITHUB_REF_NAME}.tgz.
MATRIX="openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64=ubuntu-24.04 openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64=ubuntu-24.04-arm openclaw-gateway-darwin-arm64=macos-15 openclaw-gateway-darwin-amd64=macos-15-intel"
# Linux host packages for the no-egress gate (that step is Linux-gated in the
# shared skeleton; macOS legs skip the gate — see no-egress-test.sh).
APT_PACKAGES="strace iproute2 curl"
PRE_BUILD_GATES=""
# The assembled runtime tree this leg built (package/ incl. node_modules);
# the no-egress gate starts the gateway from it the way the Dockerfile
# CMD does (`node openclaw.mjs gateway`).
EGRESS_TARGET=runtime/package
RELEASE_EXTRA="PIN=openclaw-pin.txt audit-exceptions=audit-exceptions"
RELEASE_ASSETS="openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.tgz openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.tgz openclaw-gateway-darwin-arm64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.tgz openclaw-gateway-darwin-amd64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.tgz openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-darwin-arm64-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-darwin-amd64-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-audit-full.json openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-audit-full.json openclaw-gateway-darwin-arm64-audit-full.json openclaw-gateway-darwin-amd64-audit-full.json openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-image.digest openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-image.digest openclaw-pin.txt audit-exceptions"
RELEASE_EXECUTABLES=""
RELEASE_NOTE="No tracking; OTel points only at the local collector 127.0.0.1:31415. Each gateway tarball is the Docker-runtime tree (dist + prod node_modules, symlinks kept) for its OS/arch: unpack and run with no registry access."
RELEASE_GATES="pinned commit, frozen pnpm install + pnpm build, separate frozen pnpm prod install, pnpm audit vs reviewed exceptions, runtime-tree assembly per the upstream Dockerfile + prune-docker-plugin-dist, CycloneDX SBOM of the runtime tree, bundled http-cache-semantics patch + tarball verify, no-egress (Linux legs)."
